      "common:shortName": [],
      "common:generalComment": [
        {
          "#text": "Waste Polyethylene terephthalate (PET) is a non-degradable single-use plastic and a major component of plastic waste in landfills. It is a versatile material with a wide range of applications. The demand for PET products has been steadily increasing, generating large quantities of non-biodegradable PET waste. Recycling and reuse of waste PET is an economical solution to reduce environmental pollution. It is widely used in various containers, packaging materials, and textiles.",
          "@xml:lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "#text": "废弃聚对苯二甲酸乙二醇酯（PET）是一种不可降解的一次性塑料，也是垃圾填埋场塑料废物的主要成分。它是一种用途广泛的材料。对 PET 产品的需求稳步增长，产生了大量不可生物降解的 PET 废弃物。回收和再利用废弃 PET 是减少环境污染的经济解决方案。它被广泛用于各种容器、包装材料和纺织品。",
          "@xml:lang": "zh"
        }
      ],
